    "Emergence: Turing morphogenesis, patterns from noise",
    "Shannon entropy: H = -\u03a3 p log p. Logarithm measures disorder. Factorials count arrangements. The integral named at change (seq 4.5) reappears here as expectation \u2014 sum over a distribution becomes integral in the continuous limit."
